WEBVTT

00:00.770 --> 00:03.280
Natumai tunaelewa kuhusu mitajo,

00:03.280 --> 00:05.436
kama tulivyojifunza kwenye video iliyopita, mtajo unaweza kuwa

00:05.436 --> 00:08.834
alama yoyote ile, ingawa kwa kawaida tunatumia herufi

00:08.834 --> 00:11.510
kwa sababu tunazitumia kwa kuandikia na kuchapa.

00:11.510 --> 00:17.193
Lakini inaweza kuwa kitu chochote badala ya x, y, z, a, b

00:17.193 --> 00:20.833
na mara nyingine tunaweza kutumia herufi za kigiriki kama thita.

00:20.833 --> 00:22.826
Hakika unaweza kutumia alama yoyote ile,

00:22.826 --> 00:24.090
itakayo badilisha.

00:24.090 --> 00:26.300
Tunaweza kuchukua kigawe.

00:26.300 --> 00:27.767
Kutoka kwenye herufi hizi.

00:27.767 --> 00:29.759
Miongoni mwa herufi inayotumika mara nyingi kwenye aljebra.

00:29.759 --> 00:31.754
Au kwenye hesabu zote

00:31.754 --> 00:33.703
ni mtajo "x"

00:33.703 --> 00:36.471
Ingawa zote hizi hutumika kwa kiasi fulani.

00:36.471 --> 00:39.168
Lakini tumepewa x,

00:39.168 --> 00:42.757
inayotambulisha swali.

00:42.757 --> 00:46.247
Na swali hilo, litaonekana na alama ya kuzidisha.

00:46.247 --> 00:48.501
Au tunayoitumia kwenye namba.

00:48.501 --> 00:49.924
Hivyo kwenye namba,

00:49.924 --> 00:51.209
kama tunahitaji kuandika 2 x 3.

00:51.209 --> 00:53.635
Tunaandika "2 x 3"

00:53.635 --> 00:55.481
Sasa tunaanza kutumia mitajo,

00:55.481 --> 00:57.489
kama tunahitaji kuandika " 2 mara x".

00:57.489 --> 00:59.916
Vizuri, tunatumia hii kama alama ya kuzidisha,

00:59.916 --> 01:01.533
itakuwa 2 mara x.

01:01.750 --> 01:03.491
Alama ya kuzidisha na X

01:03.598 --> 01:05.593
zinaonekana kufanana sana,

01:05.593 --> 01:08.747
kama hatutokuwa makini na uandishi

01:08.747 --> 01:10.248
itatuchanganya.

01:10.248 --> 01:11.348
Hii ni "2 x x"?

01:11.348 --> 01:13.301
Hii ni "2 mara mara kitu fulani" ?

01:13.301 --> 01:15.689
Kipi kinachoendelea hapa?

01:15.689 --> 01:18.023
Kwa kuwa hii inachanganya,

01:18.023 --> 01:21.729
Hii, hapa inachanganya zaidi.

01:21.729 --> 01:23.967
Na inaweza kufafanuliwa kimakosa,

01:23.967 --> 01:28.636
Hivyo hatutotumia alama hii ya kuzidisha,

01:28.636 --> 01:31.101
Tunapofanya aljebra.

01:31.101 --> 01:33.683
Badala ya hii, kuwakilisha kuzidisha,

01:33.683 --> 01:35.971
tuna machaguo mengi.

01:35.971 --> 01:38.692
Badala ya kuandika 2 mara x hivi,

01:38.692 --> 01:45.831
tutaandika 2 nukta x.

01:45.831 --> 01:48.434
Na hii nukta, hapa.

01:48.434 --> 01:50.683
Hii siyo desimali.

01:50.683 --> 01:52.903
Hii imeandikwa kwa juu kidogo.

01:52.903 --> 01:54.911
Na tunaandika hii, hivyo hatutochanganya

01:54.911 --> 01:57.700
kati ya hii na hii mitajo hapa.

01:57.700 --> 02:00.324
Hivyo hii, tutaisoma kama "2 mara x"

02:00.324 --> 02:02.748
Kwa mfano, mtu akisema

02:02.748 --> 02:06.995
2 nukta x, endapo x ni sawa na 3,

02:06.995 --> 02:09.762
vizuri, hii itakuwa ni sawa

02:09.762 --> 02:12.409
na 2 mara 3, kwa kuwa x ni sawa na 3.

02:12.409 --> 02:13.825
Njia nyingine za kuiandika hii ni,

02:13.825 --> 02:16.574
kuandika "2" kisha tunaandika x kwenye mabano,

02:16.574 --> 02:18.494
kwa mbele.

02:18.494 --> 02:22.221
Hii pia tunaisoma kama 2 mara x.

02:22.221 --> 02:23.285
Hivyo kwenye mazingira haya,

02:23.285 --> 02:24.504
kama "x" ilikuwa saba, hii itakuwa

02:24.504 --> 02:27.294
2 mara 7, au 14.

02:27.294 --> 02:29.671
Njia inayofahamika hapa

02:29.671 --> 02:32.302
ni kuandika x kulia baada ya 2.

02:32.302 --> 02:35.669
Wakati mwingine hii inasomeka kama "2x"

02:35.669 --> 02:39.568
Lakini hii kwa kawaida inamaanisha "2 mara x"

02:39.568 --> 02:41.633
Na tunaweza kusema, kwanini hatufanyi hivi mara zote?

02:41.633 --> 02:44.247
Vizuri, hii itatuchanganya kama tungeikokotoa hapa.

02:44.247 --> 02:46.501
Badala ya kuandika "2 mara 3"

02:46.501 --> 02:48.272
Na kuandika "2 3"

02:48.272 --> 02:49.894
Vizuri, hiyo inaonekana kama "23".

02:49.894 --> 02:51.253
Hii haionekani kama 2 mara 3.

02:51.253 --> 02:52.633
Na ndiyo maana hatukufanya hivi.

02:52.633 --> 02:54.365
Lakini hapa, kwa kuwa tunatumia herufi,

02:54.365 --> 02:57.579
Hivyo hii siyo sehemu ya namba hii.

02:57.579 --> 02:59.354
Hii siyo "Ishirini na kitu"

02:59.354 --> 03:02.838
Hii ni 2 mara mtajo x.

03:02.838 --> 03:05.900
Hivyo yote hii ni milinganyo inayofanana.

03:05.900 --> 03:09.070
2 mara x, 2 mara x na 2 mara x.

03:09.070 --> 03:10.163
Na zote hizi ni njia.

03:10.163 --> 03:13.554
Hebu! tufanye maswali mengine.

03:13.554 --> 03:14.895
Natumai swali hili litakuandaa kwa ajili ya

03:14.895 --> 03:16.215
zoezi lijalo.

03:16.215 --> 03:18.034
Ambapo utapata nafasi ya kufanya maswali.

03:18.034 --> 03:24.702
Hivyo tuseme "10 toa 3y sawa na ngapi"

03:24.702 --> 03:29.636
Na hii ni sawa na ngapi, endapo "y" ni sawa na 2.

03:29.636 --> 03:31.821
Vizuri, kuna "y" hapa

03:31.821 --> 03:32.833
Na 2 kwa hapa.

03:32.833 --> 03:35.636
Hivyo hii y ni sawa na 2.

03:35.636 --> 03:37.298
Hebu! tufanye y ni sawa na 2.

03:37.298 --> 03:41.368
Hii ni sawa na 10 toa 3 mara 2.

03:41.368 --> 03:43.503
Tunazidisha kwanza.

03:43.503 --> 03:46.369
Tunaanza kuzidisha kwanza kwa utaratibu wa hisabati.

03:46.369 --> 03:48.829
Hivyo 3 mara 2 ni 6,

03:48.829 --> 03:53.215
10 toa 6 ni sawa na 4.

03:53.215 --> 03:54.414
Hebu! tufanye mfano mwingine.

03:54.414 --> 04:08.073
Tuchukulie tuna " 7x toa 4"

04:08.073 --> 04:14.970
Na tunahitaji kuikokotoa,

04:14.970 --> 04:19.861
endapo x ni sawa na 3.

04:19.861 --> 04:22.169
Kwenye herufi x, tunaweka 3.

04:22.169 --> 04:29.221
Hivyo hii ni sawa na "7 mara 3"

04:29.221 --> 04:34.168
Natumia mtindo huu, hivyo 7 mara 3 toa 4.

04:34.168 --> 04:37.250
Kwa mara nyingine, tunaanza kuzidisha

04:37.250 --> 04:40.104
kwa utaratibu wa kihisabati, badala ya kujumlisha au kutoa.

04:40.104 --> 04:41.701
Hivyo tutaanza kuzidisha.

04:41.701 --> 04:43.970
7 mara 3 ni 21

04:43.970 --> 04:48.233
21 toa 4 ni sawa na 17.

04:48.233 --> 04:50.263
Natumai hizo zimekukumbusha kwa kiasi fulani,

04:50.263 --> 04:52.763
hivyo nakushauri ufanye zoezi linalofuata,

04:52.763 --> 04:54.367
Utapata maswali mengi ya kufanya

04:54.367 --> 04:56.357
na kujipima milinganyo kama hivi.
